    "detailed_description": "<i>\u201cLovecraft would surely be pleased seeing that his writings have inspired even text-based games to such an elaborate extent. Travelyan Home proves that eye candy is not required for a good scare.\u201d - I DO BEST</i><br><br>Follow the path of a lost soul pacing the grounds of an old and mysterious mansion as he seeks the answers of what brought him there.<br><br>Introducing a unique investigation system to discover clues, items and hidden texts that progress the story and help the player uncover the secrets of the mansion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover what lies beyond the veil</h2><br>An absorbing storyline inspired by the masterful works of Poe, Lovecraft, Ashton Smith and others with over 160,000 written words to be discovered in descriptions, clues and hidden journals. <i>(Optional accessible font included)</i><br><br>*Over 50 rooms to explore and investigate with unique settings, intrigues and characters.<br><br>*Four characters to select from with unique backgrounds and skills<br><br>*6 different endings based on the player\u2019s decisions throughout the game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your story</h2><br>Unique game mechanics combining role-playing and survival horror elements, offering a tactical gameplay where every action matters.<br><br>* Randomised events and encounters to solve, making every playthrough a unique experience<br><br>*A card-based item system with over 70 different items to help the player face the perils of the forgotten home<br><br>*A fast-paced combat system that tests your skills against what lurks in the shadows<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>\u201cLovecraft would surely be pleased seeing that his writings have inspired even text-based games to such an elaborate extent. Travelyan Home proves that eye candy is not required for a good scare.\u201d - I DO BEST</i><br><br>Follow the path of a lost soul pacing the grounds of an old and mysterious mansion as he seeks the answers of what brought him there.<br><br>Introducing a unique investigation system to discover clues, items and hidden texts that progress the story and help the player uncover the secrets of the mansion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/98d78190d897f5914009c70d6590a45d.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover what lies beyond the veil</h2><br>An absorbing storyline inspired by the masterful works of Poe, Lovecraft, Ashton Smith and others with over 160,000 written words to be discovered in descriptions, clues and hidden journals. <i>(Optional accessible font included)</i><br><br>*Over 50 rooms to explore and investigate with unique settings, intrigues and characters.<br><br>*Four characters to select from with unique backgrounds and skills<br><br>*6 different endings based on the player\u2019s decisions throughout the game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/244d7d1adae3e1fdb1c69318f7ee5030.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your story</h2><br>Unique game mechanics combining role-playing and survival horror elements, offering a tactical gameplay where every action matters.<br><br>* Randomised events and encounters to solve, making every playthrough a unique experience<br><br>*A card-based item system with over 70 different items to help the player face the perils of the forgotten home<br><br>*A fast-paced combat system that tests your skills against what lurks in the shadows<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.poster.avif?t=1591428457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.webm?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258070/extras/8bdff512188cab30af2740dce6ce0198.mp4?t=1591428457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
